=== Prompt for HW-005 (attempt 1) ===
Implement user story HW-005: Implement truncate() utility with structured output

## Story Description
Create truncate.ts in the project root. Export a single function `export function truncate(text: string, maxLength: number, suffix?: string): string` that truncates text to maxLength characters appending suffix (default '...'). If text.length <= maxLength return text unchanged. Create truncate.test.ts with at least 5 vitest tests. Do not modify any existing files.

## Acceptance Criteria
- truncate.ts exists and exports truncate with correct signature
- truncate('hello world', 5) returns 'he...'
- truncate('hi', 10) returns 'hi' unchanged
- truncate('hello', 5, '!') returns 'hell!'
- truncate.test.ts exists with at least 5 passing vitest tests
- tsc --noEmit exits 0
- vitest run exits 0 with all tests passing

